# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# assets/ carries the canonical PLUT_OS mark in two forms, and tools/build-test.mjs
# compares both byte-for-byte against their deterministic generator (tools/plutos-icon.mjs).
# Under `* text=auto` alone a Windows checkout rewrites the SVG's newline to CRLF while the
# generator emits LF, so "the committed SVG matches the canonical mark" failed there and only
# there — the windows-latest job has been red on every branch, main included, since the asset
# landed. Pinning the checkout form is the fix: the blobs are already stored LF/binary, so
# nothing is renormalized, only how they arrive in a working tree.
*.svg text eol=lf
*.ico binary

# Imported skills/packages carry byte hashes; never normalize their source bytes.
scaffold/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol

# Method packages and the optional overview keep their source bytes as committed:
# package and reporter checks compare exact hashes.
packages/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
tools/studio-control/** -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
